{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123810","id":4630715163,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFAMbGw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123810","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123810.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123810.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123810","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123810/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123810/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123810/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/81ff1c4a9d30bb598544419b7397379ce6a9a753","number":123810,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Speed up Script comparisons in `ContainerTypeValidate` and `GDScript::set`","user":{"login":"aurpine","id":12262539,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjYyNTM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12262539?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine","html_url":"https://github.com/aurpine","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Speeds up script comparisons used in type checks\r\n    - Typed `Array` and `Dictionary`\r\n    - Typed GDScript::set\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThe main change is changing the return type of `ScriptInstance::get_script` from `Ref<Script>` to `Script *`. Most of the diffs are updating the overrides or fixing callsites. Generally I tried to keep the old code the same, wrapping in a `Ref` except in very simple cases. \r\n\r\nNote I did not change some lines that did not encounter compilation errors. For example `...get_script()->get_path()` would get the benefit of not going through Ref. \r\n\r\nIn addition to the refactor, two other files have been changed for performance benefit:\r\n* `container_type_validate.cpp`\r\n* `gdscript_function.cpp`\r\n\r\n## Benchmarks\r\n\r\nProject: [script-type-checks.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32626656/script-type-checks.zip)\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Benchmark setup</summary>\r\n\r\nA.gd\r\n```gdscript\r\nclass_name A extends Object\r\n\r\nvar x: A\r\n```\r\n\r\n### `GDScript::set`\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nvar a := A.new()\r\nvar x := A.new()\r\n\r\nfor i in 50_000_000:\r\n\ta.x = x\r\n```\r\n\r\n### `Dictionary::has`\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nvar d : Dictionary[A, int]\r\nvar a := A.new()\r\n\r\nfor i in 20_000_000:\r\n\td.has(a)\r\n```\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Specs and test setup</summary>\r\nCPU: AMD 9800X3D, GPU: AMD RX 6800, RAM: 32GB 6400 CL28\r\n\r\nWindows 11, Release templates built with GCC (MinGW)\r\n\r\nEach case was run twice per project opening. Both versions (PR/Master) were opened 7 times and the 14 results were aggregated by 20th percentile. \r\n</details>\r\n\r\n| Scenario | Master (ns/op) | PR (ns/op) | Diff | Speedup |\r\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\r\n| GDScriptInstance set | 30.8 | 16.0 | -14.8 | 1.92x |\r\n| Dictionary has() | 86.7 | 29.0 | -57.7 | 2.99x |\r\n\r\n## Future Work\r\n\r\n* Apply same change to `Script::get_base_script`\r\n* Tackle other callsites of `Object::get_script`\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"st